    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 15 years ago, Niya\u2019s father gifted her the family recipe book. It had three recipes but to Niya it meant a lot. Today, Niya is forging her own path to become a chef. Still with only three recipes and a very old food cart, she dreams of running the best food cart in the city. However, she\u2019s got to get there, discover new recipes, and make connections first<br><br><br> <strong>Features</strong> <br>- Explore the world around you in this immersive open world sidescroller<br>- Make connections and discover new recipes! <br>- Create tasty dishes by chopping and cooking ingredients to the beat of the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>   <br>  <br>   <br>   </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 15 years ago, Niya\u2019s father gifted her the family recipe book. It had three recipes but to Niya it meant a lot. Today, Niya is forging her own path to become a chef. Still with only three recipes and a very old food cart, she dreams of running the best food cart in the city. However, she\u2019s got to get there, discover new recipes, and make connections first<br><br><br> <strong>Features</strong> <br>- Explore the world around you in this immersive open world sidescroller<br>- Make connections and discover new recipes! <br>- Create tasty dishes by chopping and cooking ingredients to the beat of the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>   <br>  <br>   <br>   </p>",
